Moreover, we highlight that our method is applicable without losing the theoretical validity while keeping the moderate computation, thanks to its weak reliance on estimation model size. To demonstrate this approach, we conducted additional experiment with ReFeri (Full) in addition to the experiments in Table 17, and the results are presented in below:

